<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Time on myCodingsHub</title><link>https://mycodingshub.github.io/tags/time/</link><description>Recent content in Time on myCodingsHub</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en</language><managingEditor>cpro95@gmail.com (myCodingsHub)</managingEditor><webMaster>cpro95@gmail.com (myCodingsHub)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Thu, 11 Dec 2025 08:40:00 +0900</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://mycodingshub.github.io/tags/time/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Go Concurrency 마스터하기: 시간(Time) 다루기, 더 이상 Sleep은 그만</title><link>https://mycodingshub.github.io/guides/go-concurrency-complete-guide/04-go-concurrency-time/</link><pubDate>Thu, 11 Dec 2025 08:40:00 +0900</pubDate><author>cpro95@gmail.com (myCodingsHub)</author><guid>https://mycodingshub.github.io/guides/go-concurrency-complete-guide/04-go-concurrency-time/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;이번 장에서는 동시성 프로그램에서 &lt;strong&gt;시간&lt;/strong&gt;(Time)을 다루는 다양한 기법들을 살펴봅니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;단순히 &lt;code&gt;time.Sleep&lt;/code&gt;을 쓰는 것 말고도 훨씬 우아하고 강력한 도구들이 많거든요.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;스로틀링&lt;/strong&gt;(Throttling)부터 &lt;strong&gt;백프레셔&lt;/strong&gt;(Backpressure), &lt;strong&gt;타임아웃&lt;/strong&gt;, 그리고 &lt;strong&gt;타이머와 티커&lt;/strong&gt;까지 낱낱이 파헤쳐 봅시다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>